                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.3.18+DEU.3.19+DEU.3.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nwo 3.18-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.22.1+JOS.22.2+JOS.22.3+JOS.22.4+JOS.22.5+JOS.22.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoc 22.1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yocwa dok owaco bot jo Reuben, jo Gad ki nucu kaka pa Manace ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wupo lok ma yam Moses latic pa Rwot ocikowu kwede kun wacci, ‘Rwot Lubaŋawu doŋ otyeko miyowu kabedo me yweyowu, en doŋ omiyowu lobo man.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monwu ki litinowu ki dyaŋiwu gibidoŋ i lobo ma yam Moses omiyo botwu i ŋe Jordan kany; ento oteka lweny ma gitye i kinwu ducu gibikato loka ca ki jami lwenygi ducu i nyim omegigi pi konyogi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nio ka Rwot omiyo yweyo bot omegiwu macalo omiyo botwu-ni, ci gin bene gicamo lobo ma Rwot Lubaŋawu omiyogi. Ka doŋ wubidok i lobo ma mewu-ni, ci doŋ wubibedo iye matwal, en aye lobo ma yam Moses latic pa Rwot omiyo botwu i ŋe Jordan kany ma tuŋ wokceŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci gugamo dog Yocwa ni, “Gin ma doŋ iciko ducu wabitiyo, dok ka ma icwalowa iye ducu wabicito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kit macalo yam waworo dog Moses i lok ducu-ni, wabiworo dogi bene kit meno. Rwot Lubaŋa keken aye obed kwedi, kit ma yam obedo ki Moses! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dano mo ka okwero lokki ce ojemo i kom cikki ki gin ducu ma iciko, gibineke woko. In aye ibed oteka ma cwinyi nwaŋ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
